{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1230466-2e-how-could-a-young-solar-build-up-his-arsenal-rating-in-the-fa","id":1230466,"title":"2E How could a young Solar build up his Arsenal rating in the FA?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-06-26T22:26:43-07:00","id":1230466,"title":"2E How could a young Solar build up his Arsenal rating in the FA?","content":"If you were a Solar who has been around only a few years, what would it take to start boosting your Arsenal rating?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-27T01:26:26-07:00","id":1230480,"title":"","content":"Pretty yourself up and find a sugar daddy/mommy.<br /> If they're a Sidereal or a Lunar it'll be a bit of an ego stroke, a well-connected Dragon-Blooded might see this relationship as a career making move.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-27T04:16:38-07:00","id":1230491,"title":"","content":"Just &quot;borrow&quot; some equipment from wealthier Exalts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-27T05:50:28-07:00","id":1230514,"title":"","content":"Inherit after your prior exaltation of an Arms Dealer.<br /> <br /> Apprentice under a current Arms Dealer.<br /> <br /> Become newly named leader of a crack military squad.<br /> <br /> Join crack military squad, have Arsenal rating cover standard squad equipment.<br /> <br /> Become inventory specialist for Twilight Artificer so he can focus on making more Arsenal.<br /> <br /> Blow your prior incarnation allowance on collecting replicas of everyone else's Artifacts. (2 dot items as basic copies of famous 4-5 dot items). Ask anyone more important than you to sign your daiklave.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24220-cryo-seraph","name":"Cryo-Seraph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24220_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-27T08:01:22-07:00","id":1230543,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1230466-2e-how-could-a-young-solar-build-up-his-arsenal-rating-in-the-fa?p=1230491#post1230491\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just &quot;borrow&quot; some equipment from wealthier Exalts?</div> </div> </div> </div>I thought Arsenal was primarily a license to own lots of super weapons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-28T10:21:56-07:00","id":1230853,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1230466-2e-how-could-a-young-solar-build-up-his-arsenal-rating-in-the-fa?p=1230543#post1230543\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I thought Arsenal was primarily a license to own lots of super weapons.</div> </div> </div> </div>From what I remember reading, a long time ago, it isn't.<br /> <br /> It is owning the gear, but you had to justify it with other backgrounds, like Backing, Wealth, Influence etc...<br /> <br /> Might be misremembering though.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2746-tgueiros","name":"TGUEIROS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2746_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-28T10:56:30-07:00","id":1230862,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TGUEIROS</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1230466-2e-how-could-a-young-solar-build-up-his-arsenal-rating-in-the-fa?p=1230853#post1230853\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> From what I remember reading, a long time ago, it isn't.<br /> <br /> It is owning the gear, but you had to justify it with other backgrounds, like Backing, Wealth, Influence etc...<br /> <br /> Might be misremembering though.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, I just reread it and you are correct.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-28T11:52:05-07:00","id":1230879,"title":"","content":"Arsenal is equipment that isn't yours and you're going to be expected to justify it being lost or broken to whomever provided it.<br /> I have seen it (along with Liege and Infamy) used as a way to obtain a powerful one use weapon such as a Soubreaker Orb with the idea being that when you eventually use it you'll have an opportunity to explain that you needed to do that and thus be in a better position than you would've been for buying a one-shot artifact.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-28T12:58:02-07:00","id":1230902,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cryo-Seraph</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1230466-2e-how-could-a-young-solar-build-up-his-arsenal-rating-in-the-fa?p=1230514#post1230514\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Inherit after your prior exaltation of an Arms Dealer.<br /> <br /> Apprentice under a current Arms Dealer.</div> </div> </div> </div>Arms dealer to who?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-28T19:18:38-07:00","id":1230984,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1230466-2e-how-could-a-young-solar-build-up-his-arsenal-rating-in-the-fa?p=1230879#post1230879\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Arsenal is equipment that isn't yours and you're going to be expected to justify it being lost or broken to whomever provided it.<br /> I have seen it (along with Liege and Infamy) used as a way to obtain a powerful one use weapon such as a Soubreaker Orb with the idea being that when you eventually use it you'll have an opportunity to explain that you needed to do that and thus be in a better position than you would've been for buying a one-shot artifact.</div> </div> </div> </div>Again, been a long time, but I didn't get this impression from it.<br /> <br /> It is gear you can own, through Wealth, but possibly gear that other powerful people don't want you to have and may want justification for your use of it, or may sanction or move against you for using it. And that is for the high levels, the lower levels came with no other requirements or strings attached.<br /> <br /> But you can own your Arsenal, as far as I remember anyways.<br /> <br /> Might re-download when I have a chance to see.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2746-tgueiros","name":"TGUEIROS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2746_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-28T19:45:14-07:00","id":1230991,"title":"","content":"Ah, I see.<br /> I'm recalling the Arsenal background as it appears in the Dragon-Blooded book which means something completely different to the one in Dreams of the First Age. That's so fucking weird.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-28T20:14:29-07:00","id":1230996,"title":"","content":"To elaborate on the &quot;borrow/sugar daddy&quot; sort of suggestions, try getting into the good graces of your former incarnation's Circle, Lunar mate, Dragon-Blooded flunkies, Sidereal advisors, etc. Important relationships could last across multiple reincarnations, and it wouldn't be surprising for them to gift/loan you some of their own surplus equipment if you made a good impression.<br /> <br /> If you're far enough into the FA that it was recognized that all Celestials would eventually die, see if you willed some of your own past life stuff to your new incarnation. Considering that elder Celestials might start seeing things in terms of decades and centuries, maybe the executor just hasn't gotten around to finding you yet.<br /> <br /> Attend Deliberative meetings, and exchange your vote for stuff if it seems like an issue is going to be a close vote.<br /> <br /> If you're a crafter sort, find someone to apprentice to and start learning how to make them. It'll take a while to get up to Arsenal levels, but you've got the time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2433-highpriest","name":"HighPriest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2433_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-29T22:56:13-07:00","id":1231304,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1230466-2e-how-could-a-young-solar-build-up-his-arsenal-rating-in-the-fa?p=1230902#post1230902\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Arms dealer to who?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm sure some Twilight or Dawn focused on making weapons Factory Cathedral style en masse in Dreams ended up with surpluses after a point, and other Solars or Government forces would love their overstock. They get their circle's Eclipse to negotiate prices. Their trade prince rival catches windxand wants to do the same thing, and bam, two groups competing to sell weapons. arms dealing. And being Arsenal style focused suggests more of those 'I want my entire Dragon-Blooded Calvalry Legion to have Gunzosha Armor, a daiklave and a battle bike' orders than the high pedigree of a personal assortment of artifacts that screams 2nd edition 1st age.<br /> <br /> And if First Age Tony Stark can't make a bad deal to the wrong crowd for a decent incarnation flashback, who could? Replace his eacape with waking up an age later. That is a fun 3rd ed solar crafter to run.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24220-cryo-seraph","name":"Cryo-Seraph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24220_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-30T15:54:37-07:00","id":1231469,"title":"","content":"I don't know... eh, my thoughts on the subject don't matter. Probably kind of nitpicky.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}